    skos:broader cwe:CWE-59 ;
    skos:definition "The product, when opening a file or directory, does not sufficiently handle when the file is a Windows shortcut (.LNK) whose target is outside of the intended control sphere. This could allow an attacker to cause the product to operate on unauthorized files."@en ;
