    rdfs:seeAlso <https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/757.html> ;
    skos:broader cwe:CWE-693 ;
    skos:definition "A protocol or its implementation supports interaction between multiple actors and allows those actors to negotiate which algorithm should be used as a protection mechanism such as encryption or authentication, but it does not select the strongest algorithm that is available to both parties."@en ;
