    skos:broader cwe:CWE-77 ;
    skos:definition "The product constructs all or part of an OS command using externally-influenced input from an upstream component, but it does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes special elements that could modify the intended OS command when it is sent to a downstream component."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/cwe> ;
